# The RP restarts during a job, as the ST sees it (request 255, the
# firmware's own: ROM3 given back as test data, the job forgotten, a new boot
# ID). The program reports the restart, selects ROM3 again and keeps taking
# requests.
@debug
@bench commands
say "^PASS  The device takes commands" 500
request 1 1 20
say "^Bench: test 1" 500
request 255
say "^FAIL  The device restarted during test 1" 1500
say "^Bench: done" 500
sayn 2 "^PASS  The device takes commands" 3000
request 1 1 2
sayn 2 "^Bench: done" 6000
say "^  seconds=2" 100
request 3
say "^Bench mode: stopped by the RP" 500
